    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kehoe Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this spacious four-bedroom detached bungalow, occupying a generous site of approximately 2,800 sq. m. (c. 0.69 acre) in a peaceful rural setting just outside Tullow. The well-proportioned accommodation is arranged entirely at ground-floor level and comprises an entrance porch and hallway, a substantial living room with bay window and feature fireplace, a large fitted kitchen/dining room, four bedrooms, a family bathroom with bath and separate shower, together with separate utility and laundry rooms. The practical layout provides comfortable family accommodation while offering excellent scope for a purchaser to update and personalise the property to their own requirements. \n\n\nExternally, a broad tarmacadam forecourt provides ample off-street parking, while the house is surrounded by extensive lawned gardens enjoying a desirable south-facing aspect and mature boundaries. A garage/workshop provides valuable storage and practical workspace. The property benefits from oil-fired central heating, a private well and septic tank. Ardoyne is a rural townland on the outskirts of Tullow, combining countryside living with convenient access to the town`s supermarkets, restaurants, schools and everyday services. Mount Wolseley Hotel, Spa & Golf Resort is also nearby, while Tullow is approximately 16 km southeast of Carlow Town."
      },
      {
